## Conventions

Every component below must honour these defaults; entries only call out departures.

- **Tokens by name, never hex.** `var(--accent)`, never `#......`. See DESIGN.md §2 (OKLCH canonical).
- **Universal states**: `default` / `hover` / `focus` (`:focus-visible` 3px `--accent` ring, 2px offset) / `active` / `disabled` / `loading` / `error` (border + icon + text — never colour-only) / `success` (border + ✓ icon + text — never green-only).
- **Touch targets ≥ 48 px** on every interactive control.
- **`prefers-reduced-motion`** respected globally.
- **WCAG-AA** on every text pair; verify and document the ratio.
- **Numerals**: `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums` on every digit.
- **Citations** (where AI-derived data is shown): visible badge inline; full source on `title` attribute.
- **Verb + object** on every button label.

